# Quick Play (Practice, Normal): a manual call (Space), a hint (H), a mark on an uncalled number
# (refused, −25) undone (U), a false claim refused, the pause dialog's Help and back, then Leave round.
until 300 Lantern Bingo
frames 60
click =Play
until 60 Unranked practice
frames 10
click =Start
until 300 Round active
frames 10
key Space 1
frames 10
expect Calls: 1
key KeyH 1
frames 10
save practice-hint
click row 1 column 1, number
frames 10
expect has not been called yet
save practice-invalid
key KeyU 1
frames 10
expect invalid −0
key KeyP 1
until 60 Take your time
frames 10
click =Help
until 60 Fair play
frames 10
click =Back
until 60 Take your time
frames 10
click =Leave round
until 60 =Play
frames 10
